Mode Description General Purpose (default) Lowest latency; suitable for most workloads Max I/O Higher aggregate throughput at higher latency; legacy, use only for HPC Elastic throughput (default) Scales automatically to workload; best for spiky access patterns Provisioned throughput Fixed MiB/s regardless of storage size; for sustained high throughput Bursting throughput Throughput scales with storage size + burst credits; predictable workloads <pre><code>resource "aws_efs_file_system" "shared" {
