  security_groups = [aws_security_group.efs.id]
}
</code></pre>

Type Description Best for System node pool Runs critical system pods (coredns, metrics-server) Required in every cluster User node pool Workload pods, separate from system Isolate workloads by pool Spot node pool Evictable VMs at deep discount Batch, CI runners Virtual nodes (ACI) Serverless burst; no VM provisioning Spiky workloads <pre><code>resource "azurerm_kubernetes_cluster" "main" {
