Type Description Example Basic Broad legacy roles <code>roles/viewer</code>, <code>roles/editor</code>, <code>roles/owner</code> Predefined Service-specific curated roles <code>roles/container.developer</code> Custom Organisation-defined set of permissions <code>CustomRole/ciDeploy</code> <pre><code># Grant a CI service account permission to push to Artifact Registry
resource "google_project_iam_member" "ci_push" {
  project = var.project_id
  role    = "roles/artifactregistry.writer"
  member  = "serviceAccount:${google_service_account.ci.email}"
}

# Grant GKE developer access — cluster-scoped Kubernetes RBAC is set separately
resource "google_project_iam_member" "gke_developer" {
  project = var.project_id
  role    = "roles/container.developer"
  member  = "group:developers@mycompany.com"
